{"about_the_game":"<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2429050/extras/aa7250a1f1b0040fee9802ce9ee74157.poster.avif?t=1772563723\" width=630 height=162 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2429050/extras/aa7250a1f1b0040fee9802ce9ee74157.webm?t=1772563723\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2429050/extras/aa7250a1f1b0040fee9802ce9ee74157.mp4?t=1772563723\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Play as <strong>Rob</strong>, a friendly musician trying to <strong>restore harmony</strong> in an off-tuned world where wacky villains are <strong>corrupting music</strong>. <br><br><strong>Rick Riffson</strong>, boss of the evil Super Metal Records company, is using the <strong>Battle of the Bands contest</strong> to extend his hold on every last note, chord, and song by trapping the best musicians with <strong>deceptive soul-binding contracts</strong>.  <br><br>Embark on an adventure with <strong>Rob and his zany rock-loving friend</strong> to end SMR's plans. Stay alert during your journey: Riffson\u2019s <strong>devilish goons</strong>, <strong>monster-instrument hybrids</strong>, and <strong>legendary musical animals</strong> will try to get in your way!<br><br>Explore this musical land to<strong> add sick riffs to your deck</strong>, and <strong>wield your mighty guitar</strong> to unleash powerful crescendo attacks in <strong>epic music battles</strong>! <br><br>Carefully composed by <strong>Ritual Studios</strong>, Fretless is a <strong>pixel-art adventure</strong> set in Rob Scallon and his friends' <strong>diverse musical rock world</strong>.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2429050/extras/ee4c935d88536556e699431a3b9e7a0e.poster.avif?t=1772563723\" width=630 height=162 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2429050/extras/ee4c935d88536556e699431a3b9e7a0e.webm?t=1772563723\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2429050/extras/ee4c935d88536556e699431a3b9e7a0e.mp4?t=1772563723\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >GAME FEATURES</h2><br><strong>- Explore a musical world:</strong> discover whimsical biomes where flowers jingle, rocks really rock and beach waves have their own melody. Watch out for the percushrooms: they'll beat you up.<br><br><strong>- Engage in musical turn-based combat:</strong> orchestrate melodies of mighty musical riffs to bit crush your foes. Plug your instrument, stay on the beat, and unleash powerful crescendo attacks!<br><br><strong>- Fine-tune your strategy: </strong> Collect mighty riffs, add them to your deck, and compose the perfect bars to create unbeatable solos. Follow the beat of your own drum, whether it is high damage build, devastating musical effects, life-stealing combos, or even random chaos!<br><br><strong>- Spice up your musical abilities with physical add-ons:</strong> Are you a metal-rock shredder or an indie-folk lover? Choose the best instrument and add bridges, strings, and more to match your own play styles.<br><br><strong>- Band together for a wholesome ballad:</strong> embark on a story full of musical puns, zany characters, and Rob Scallon's coterie of music-loving friends<br><br><strong>- Enjoy a hand-crafted Pixel Art symphony:</strong> progress through a visually enchanting world filled with gorgeous punchy animations and alluring scenery.<br><br><strong>- Music is for everyone: </strong>from &quot;simple&quot; music enthusiasts to guitar gods, everyone can hit the right note at the right time! Whether you are already a fan of Rob or just looking for a fun lighthearted adventure, this game is made for you.<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2429050/extras/7e18498fd0d37baccfc27836f2a56830.poster.avif?t=1772563723\" width=630 height=162 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2429050/extras/7e18498fd0d37baccfc27836f2a56830.webm?t=1772563723\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2429050/extras/7e18498fd0d37baccfc27836f2a56830.mp4?t=1772563723\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"One Down...","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2429050/a82343b282613ca64224f039d4640da16f59e430.jpg"},{"name":"The Unnatural Beast","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2429050/1c275b91277451b6f945a5d88e113f41c3bb328a.jpg"},{"name":"Molten Metal ","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2429050/0630f924ba4607c2d94afbab0fdc7673d41f7a35.jpg"},{"name":"One To Go...","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2429050/2d5ec7c186b1f1150e4502c37501d8c1ee6a4c4d.jpg"},{"name":"The CEO","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2429050/2b8a00c1c31a1d3e0ec326828a61e8e3d1f4ecce.jpg"},{"name":"The Hero of Might and Music","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2429050/26cef4f64affb0dc938c6bea2cd3679afe97766a.jpg"},{"name":"Guitarist","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2429050/e52b720f96d9f57acad0ed8d0898243c756194c8.jpg"},{"name":"Bassist","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2429050/5206095c58b9ea77cd5530421729f5fdac0a4845.jpg"},{"name":"Synthesist","path":"https://cdn.akamai.